  `launch/`, and isn't part of what `patches/*.patch` touches.
- `0013`'s second hunk (the `-> tuple[list[int], int, bool]` return-type
  fixup in `vllm/v1/structured_output/__init__.py`) failed to apply as a
  literal patch (raw `diff -u`-style headers in the source patch,
  whitespace-sensitive) despite its context matching our tree
  byte-for-byte; applied the identical semantic change by hand instead
  of forcing a fuzzy match.

